---
// Footer.astro
---

<footer id="contato" class="bg-slate-950 border-t border-slate-900 pt-20 pb-10">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-12 mb-16">
      <!-- Brand column -->
      <div class="space-y-4 md:col-span-2">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <div class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-tr from-brand-600 to-pink-500 shadow-md">
            <span class="text-base font-bold text-white">S</span>
          </div>
          <span class="text-xl font-extrabold text-white">
            Salon<span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-400 to-pink-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent">Flow</span>
          </span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed max-w-sm">
          Unindo profissionalismo, sofisticação e tecnologia para proporcionar a você a melhor experiência em serviços de beleza.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Opening Hours column -->
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider">Horários</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-sm text-slate-400">
          <li>Segunda a Sexta: <span class="text-slate-200">08:00 às 18:00</span></li>
          <li>Sábados: <span class="text-slate-200">08:00 às 14:00</span></li>
          <li>Domingos: <span class="text-slate-200">Fechado</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Address column -->
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider">Endereço</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          Av. Paulista, 1000 - Bela Vista<br />
          São Paulo - SP, 01310-100<br />
          <span class="text-brand-400 mt-2 block hover:underline">
            <a href="tel:+5511999999999">(11) 99999-9999</a>
          </span>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Copyright -->
    <div class="pt-8 border-t border-slate-900/80 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-slate-500">
      <p>&copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} SalonFlow. Todos os direitos reservados.</p>
      <div class="flex gap-6">
        <a href="#" class="hover:text-slate-300">Termos de Uso</a>
        <a href="#" class="hover:text-slate-300">Política de Privacidade</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
